      "section": "dsh-notify-relay · 手机信使",
      "text": "Let your AI **proactively notify your phone** when long tasks finish, when things break, or when a decision is needed."
    },
    {
      "section": "支持",
      "text": "**Server酱**(sc.ftqq.com)·**Bark**(iOS)·**Gotify**·任意接收`{title,message}`的webhook。面板配置里填webhook地址即用（或环境变量`DSH_NOTIFY_WEBHOOK`）。"
    },
    {
      "section": "常驻纪律",
      "text": "该推：长任务完成（结果+读数）/出错（错因+下一步）/需决策（选项列清）。不该推：中间进度、能自愈的小事、过程日志。**通知是打扰，内容必须值回打扰成本。**"
    },
    {
